#: ../src/cookbook/configuring-xdebug.md
msgid "[PhpStorm servers and path mappings](https://www.jetbrains.com/help/phpstorm/servers.html)"
msgstr "[Servidores e mapeamentos de caminhos no PhpStorm](https://www.jetbrains.com/help/phpstorm/servers.html)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/configuring-xdebug.md
msgid "[VS Code PHP Debug](https://github.com/xdebug/vscode-php-debug)"
msgstr "[VS Code PHP Debug](https://github.com/xdebug/vscode-php-debug)"

