#: ../src/cookbook/configuring-xdebug.md
msgid "[Zed PHP documentation](https://zed.dev/docs/languages/php#debugging)"
msgstr "[Documentação de PHP no Zed](https://zed.dev/docs/languages/php#debugging)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/configuring-xdebug.md
msgid "[Docker in application templates](../guide/tutorial/docker.md)"
msgstr "[Docker nos templates de aplicação](../guide/tutorial/docker.md)"
